"Writing the `orders` table definition to `migration/schema.sql`.The `migration/schema.sql` file now contains the `orders` table definition with:\n\n- `id` — identity column (primary key)\n- `status` — text with default `'pending'`\n- `total_amount` — `NUMERIC(12, 2)`\n- `tax_amount` — stored generated column equal to 10% of `total_amount`\n\nThe syntax is PostgreSQL-compatible (generated columns require PostgreSQL 12+)."